# CRITICAL RULES - READ THIS FIRST

## ✅ BEFORE GENERATING CODE - CHECKLIST
1. Check `src/css/themes/dark.scss` and `light.scss` for available colors
2. Use ONLY `--nexa-*` CSS variables
3. NEVER use Quasar default colors
4. Minimize wrapper elements

---

## 🚫 NEVER USE (절대 사용 금지)

### Quasar Colors
❌ color="primary", color="secondary", color="accent"
❌ bg-primary, text-secondary, text-grey-7
❌ $primary, $secondary, $grey-1 (SCSS variables)
❌ class="text-positive text-negative text-info"

### Bad Practices
❌ Inline color styles: `:style="{ color: '#fff' }"`
❌ Multiple unnecessary wrapper divs
❌ 2중, 3중 래퍼 요소

---

## ✅ ALWAYS USE (필수 사항)

### NEXA Theme Variables
✅ `var(--nexa-background)`
✅ `var(--nexa-text-primary)`
✅ `var(--nexa-button-primary-bg)`
✅ All variables follow: `--nexa-{category}-{property}` pattern

### File Locations
- Theme files: `src/css/themes/dark.scss`, `light.scss`
- Check these files for ALL available variables

### Creating New Variables
- Pattern: `--nexa-{category}-{property}`
- Add to BOTH dark.scss and light.scss
- Add comment: `// Added: {date/reason}`

---

## 🎯 QUICK REFERENCE

### Common Variables
```scss
// Backgrounds
var(--nexa-background)
var(--nexa-surface)
var(--nexa-surface-hover)

// Text
var(--nexa-text-primary)
var(--nexa-text-secondary)
var(--nexa-text-disabled)

// Buttons
var(--nexa-button-primary-bg)
var(--nexa-button-primary-text)
var(--nexa-button-secondary-bg)

// Borders
var(--nexa-border-color)
var(--nexa-border-hover)

// Status
var(--nexa-success)
var(--nexa-error)
var(--nexa-warning)
```

---

## 💡 USAGE EXAMPLES

### Vue Component
```vue
<template>
  <div class="my-component">Content</div>
</template>

<style lang="scss" scoped>
.my-component {
  background-color: var(--nexa-background);
  color: var(--nexa-text-primary);
  border: 1px solid var(--nexa-border-color);
  
  &:hover {
    background-color: var(--nexa-surface-hover);
  }
}
</style>
```

### Good DOM Structure
```vue
<!-- ✅ GOOD: Minimal wrapper -->
<template>
  <section class="content">
    <header>Title</header>
    <article>Content</article>
  </section>
</template>

<!-- ❌ BAD: Unnecessary wrappers -->
<template>
  <div>
    <div>
      <div class="content">...</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</template>
```

---

## 📐 SCSS ARCHITECTURE

### Level Structure
1. `quasar.variables.scss` - Quasar overrides (SCSS vars only)
2. `utils/` - Mixins, functions, utilities
3. `app.scss` - Global base styles
4. `themes/` - Theme color variables (CSS vars only)
5. `nexa-system/` - NEXA global styles
6. Component SCSS - Component-specific styles

### Principles
- ✅ Variables first (colors, sizes, spacing)
- ✅ Scoped styles in components
- ✅ Minimize global overrides
- ✅ Semantic HTML elements

**Full documentation**: `docs/NEXA-SCSS_ARCHITECTURE.md`

---

## ⚡ FINAL REMINDERS

1. **Check theme files FIRST** before writing any color code
2. **Use `--nexa-*` variables ONLY** - never Quasar defaults
3. **Keep DOM structure simple** - avoid unnecessary wrappers
4. **When in doubt** - check the theme files for available variables
